Hi HN,<p>I built Jetcaller (<a href="https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jetcaller.com" rel="nofollow">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jetcaller.com</a>
), a simple web app for making international calls directly from the browser — no installs or SIM.<p>Built it after getting tired of clunky international calling setups while working remotely. I intentionally kept it minimal and shipped early instead of overbuilding.<p>It’s live and very early. Would love feedback on usefulness, or anything that feels unnecessary.<p>Happy to answer questions.
— Sankar
